flowchart TD
    User([User]) -->|Sends Message| PM(process_message)
    
    subgraph Orchestrator [Orchestrator]
        PM --> DI(detect_intent API)
        DI --> C{Intent?}
        C -->|Specific Intent| RQ(rewrite_query API)
        C -->|General Chat| MU[Save User Msg to memory_manager]
        RQ --> MU
        MU --> FC(format_chat_history)
        FC --> CallAgent(Call ask_agent)
        
        Synth(synthesize_response API) --> MA[Save Assistant Msg to memory_manager]
    end
    
    subgraph MetaAgent [Meta Creative Agent]
        CallAgent -->|Search Query & Session ID| AgentProcess(Agent LangGraph)
        AgentProcess <--> Tools{Agent Tools}
        Tools <--> T1[list_ads_with_creatives]
        Tools <--> T2[get_ad_performance_insights]
        Tools <--> T3[search_ad_library]
        AgentProcess -->|Raw Agent Output| Synth
    end
    
    MA -->|Final Response| User